# The Meta AI API key for SpotCool's agent (SAM 3.1, muse-wonder, muse-voice-transcribe).
# Copy this file OUTSIDE the repo, fill in the key there, and pass that file to the agent:
#   uv run spotcool-agent run --vision meta --env-file <path outside the repo>
# Never commit a key. CI's hygiene job allows only this template.
META_API_KEY=
